---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/content';
---
<Base title="Impressum & privacy" description="Legal notice and privacy policy for Casa Bloom, city garden in Zürich." solidNav>
  <main class="wrap legal">
    <h2>Impressum</h2>
    <p>Casa Bloom<br>Annina Babini<br>Brandschenkestrasse 172<br>8002 Zürich, Switzerland<br><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <h3>Who is responsible</h3>
    <p>Annina Babini, Casa Bloom, at the address above. For anything about your data, write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

    <h3>Workshop notifications</h3>
    <p>If you leave your email address in the "Notify me" form, I use it only to tell you about Bloom Bar workshop dates. The form is processed by the hosting provider of this website, which may store the address on servers outside Switzerland, for example in the EU or the USA, with appropriate safeguards in place. I don't share it with anyone else and never sell it. Write to me any time and I'll delete it.</p>

    <h3>Emails</h3>
    <p>If you email me, I use your message and address only to answer you.</p>

    <h3>Hosting and visits</h3>
    <p>When you visit this site, the hosting provider automatically records technical data such as your IP address, browser and time of access, to deliver the site and keep it secure. This site uses no cookies, no analytics and no tracking. Fonts are loaded from this site, not from Google.</p>

    <h3>Instagram</h3>
    <p>Links to Instagram take you to a site run by Meta, where Meta's own privacy policy applies.</p>

    <h3>Your rights</h3>
    <p>Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection you can ask what data I hold about you, and have it corrected or deleted.</p>

    <h3>Changes</h3>
    <p>I may update this page from time to time. The current version always applies.</p>

    <p class="legal__date">Last updated: November 2026</p>
  </main>
</Base>
